This product is a migration of franka_description and includes software developed
by Franka Robotics GmbH.

Modifications by Agile Robots SE:
  The following files are derived from franka_description and were modified by
  Agile Robots SE to describe the Diana series robots (Diana3, Diana7, Diana7G2):
  the URDF/SRDF xacro macros, robot descriptions and robot parameter YAML files
  under robots/, accessories/ and end_effectors/, the launch, rviz, scripts, test
  and .docker files, and the package build files (CMakeLists.txt, package.xml).
  Source files that carry a license header also state the modification in that
  header.

Third-party assets:
  The diana_head accessory is taken from the franka_head_v0_2 accessory of
  franka_description, Copyright 2023 Franka Robotics GmbH, licensed under the
  Apache License, Version 2.0. Its meshes
  (meshes/accessories/diana_head/visual/diana_head.dae and
  meshes/accessories/diana_head/collision/diana_head.stl) and parameter files
  (accessories/diana_head/inertials.yaml and kinematics.yaml) are unmodified
  copies under new file names; accessories/diana_head/diana_head.xacro was
  adapted from franka_head.xacro.

